Reference outputs for ADR 0018: inputs where a tab is partly consumed by
the prefix of nested containers. The *.html files are the output of
commonmark.js 0.31.2 (the reference implementation for spec 0.31.2).

To regenerate, in a scratch directory:

  npm install commonmark@0.31.2
  node generate-reference.js <this directory>

generate-reference.js lists the inputs and writes both the .md and .html
files.
